DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ist schon in Ordnung, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich bin schon mehr als glücklich,
dass du hier bist, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} du hast keins dabei?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Das macht
aber nichts...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Es gibt sowieso kein besseres
Geschenk als deine Anwesenheit!{{TAG:0003:0026:}}

{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Ist das wirklich für mich?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Also gut,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
dann mach ich mich gleich mal ans
Auspacken!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ma questa torta è fantastica!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Ha un aspetto magnifico!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Muchas gracias,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Con una torta così, qualsiasi festa
diventa un veglione,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} non trovi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Oh! {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I already have this exact thing.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
It's my favorite thing ever, so it
gets a lot of use!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I'm so happy!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} I can replace the old
one with the brand-new one now!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Thanks,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¿Eh? {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}Gracias, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}No me esperaba un regalo así,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
pero me alegra saber que
te {{TAG:0003:0025:}}has acordado de mí.

¡No pienses que soy superficial!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}
No solo estoy contento porque
me has hecho un regalo{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}¡Mi felicidad se debe en gran parte
a que estás pasando mi cumpleaños
conmigo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

FR:
C'est trop génial d'être connu !{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Tout le monde vous aime et vous
offre des cadeaux ! {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}¡Vaya,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Es la primera vez que alguien
se porta así conmigo.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Ich bin so ein Glückspilz...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} und {{TAG:0005:0008:}}...{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Mit euch beiden feiern zu dürfen, ist
einfach zu schön, um wahr zu sein!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}That present you gave to me{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}I'll treasure it forever and ever
and never forget you!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Siempre que vea el regalo que
me has dado,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} me acordaré de ti.{{TAG:0003:0026:}}
¡Lo guardaré como oro en paño!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ogni volta che vedrò il tuo regalo{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}penserò a te e alla nostra bella
amicizia! Sniff... sniff...!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Bana verdiğin hediye...{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} onu{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}
sonsuza dek saklayacağım ve seni
asla unutmayacağım!

{{TAG:0003:0006:}}İçimde bir his var;
arkadaşlıktan da öte
olabiliriz...{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} EN{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}} İYİ arkadaşlar olabiliriz!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Oh?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Gehst du schon wieder?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Danke noch mal für dein Geschenk.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Ich hab mich echt riesig darüber
gefreut, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡Gracias por venir!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} Ah, claro,
y gracias por el regalo también.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}¡Ha sido un día inolvidable!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Danke, dass du gekommen bist!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Oh,
und danke für das Geschenk...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Diesen Tag werde ich nie vergessen!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Oh, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}are you already leaving,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Thanks for taking the time to come
to my birthday party today!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Aa,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} şimdiden mi gidiyorsun,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
